  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "What keeps an AI answer from becoming an unsafe action?",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 3.1758986648408083,
      "chapter": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "EMOS places deterministic controls around model reasoning, including input fencing,",
      "start": 3.1758986648408083,
      "end": 8.275659020883259,
      "chapter": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "output validation, canonical six R checks, and secret redaction.",
      "start": 8.275659020883259,
      "end": 12.24553235193427,
      "chapter": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "Adversarial requests to bypass governance are intercepted.",
      "start": 12.24553235193427,
      "end": 15.558849709003766,
      "chapter": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Evidence requirements and explicit human approval remain authoritative, regardless of",
      "start": 15.558849709003766,
      "end": 19.95624786032181,
      "chapter": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "the wording or confidence of a model response.",
      "start": 19.95624786032181,
      "end": 22.063334474495036,
      "chapter": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Software tests, deterministic evaluations, and recorded live checks provide bounded",
      "start": 22.063334474495036,
      "end": 27.34631975350907,
      "chapter": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "evidence about tested behavior. They do not prove perfect AI, zero hallucinations, or",
      "start": 27.34631975350907,
      "end": 32.73618623758987,
      "chapter": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "universal safety.",
      "start": 32.73618623758987,
      "end": 33.72865457035262,
      "chapter": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "When AI reasoning is unavailable, the interface discloses a deterministic fallback.",
      "start": 33.72865457035262,
      "end": 38.72153372132831,
      "chapter": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Next, inspect the Evaluation Evidence and the workload's actual evidence gaps before",
      "start": 38.72153372132831,
      "end": 43.50065046217049,
      "chapter": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "relying on a recommendation.",
      "start": 43.50065046217049,
      "end": 44.602542,
      "chapter": 3
    }
  ],
